BEHAVIOR array-set

DESCRIPTION
  Overwrites the element at index (0-based) of an int array with value. Does
  not change len; the caller is responsible for index < len.

CONTRACT
  INPUT arr bytes 65536
  INPUT index int 8
  INPUT value int 8

HASH ed299b48

IMPLEMENTATION
  iv = LOAD index 8
  v = LOAD value 8
  e = IMUL iv 8 8
  off = IADD e 16 8
  STORE arr v 8 off
END
